    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You are harder to move than most people are willing to try for.”</em></p><p><strong>Stone Patience.</strong> You passively know, without rolling, the approximate age and structural integrity of any object you touch. Additionally, once per Soma Break, as a bonus action, you may anchor yourself: until the start of your next turn, you cannot be moved against your will, knocked prone, or made shaken. Forced movement effects targeting you fail cleanly; the aggressor knows it.</p>",
